cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "InsectTrack: Detection, Tracking and Activity Mapping of Insects in Videos"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rahimi
    given-names: Ehsan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8401-472X"
  - family-names: Jung
    given-names: Chuleui
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ehsanrahimi666/InsectTrack"
abstract: >-
  An R package with an optional Python back end that detects insects in videos
  with trained YOLO models, open-vocabulary detectors or background
  subtraction, tracks them with multi-object trackers, and converts the tracks
  into activity time series, heat maps and hot spots, visits to regions,
  entrance counts and interactions, with an annotated video in which every
  insect has its own colour and identity label.
keywords:
  - insect monitoring
  - multi-object tracking
  - video analysis
  - pollinators
  - R package
